WEBVTT

00:01:36.100 --> 00:01:37.190
Itadakimasu!

00:01:43.860 --> 00:01:45.320
How rude.

00:01:45.320 --> 00:01:47.440
Why would I give you something rotten?

00:01:47.910 --> 00:01:48.380
Both the soybean paste and the seaweed are newly bought.

00:01:48.380 --> 00:01:49.300
Hey, hey?

00:01:49.300 --> 00:01:50.560
Is that Oori?

00:01:50.560 --> 00:01:50.580
Let me talk to him.

00:01:50.580 --> 00:01:52.680
But it's so spicy.

00:01:53.040 --> 00:01:54.700
It tastes strangely.

00:01:54.700 --> 00:01:55.310
Spicy?

00:01:57.310 --> 00:02:00.210
Oori, you did wash the salt off the seaweed, right?

00:02:00.660 --> 00:02:01.920
Wash the salt off?

00:02:03.070 --> 00:02:06.390
Oh, is this the same one brother is always using?

00:02:06.990 --> 00:02:11.150
Keisei always washed the salt off before using it, right?

00:02:11.460 --> 00:02:13.610
I didn't know bro knew such detailed stuff.

00:02:14.030 --> 00:02:15.870
He didn't used to.

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:18.550
But he learned such stuff since you came.

00:02:20.330 --> 00:02:23.120
He hasn't shown up lately but...

00:02:23.460 --> 00:02:23.880
Gimme!

00:02:24.380 --> 00:02:25.730
Hey, Hanagami!

00:02:25.730 --> 00:02:28.180
Don't try to cook something you can't.

00:02:28.180 --> 00:02:28.790
Shut up!

00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:32.120
Are you and Keisei fighting, Oori?

00:02:33.220 --> 00:02:34.860
You shouldn't fight!

00:02:37.610 --> 00:02:38.550
You're right.

00:02:45.890 --> 00:02:46.830
Shikei!

00:02:46.830 --> 00:02:48.500
Tagami Shikei, wait!

00:02:48.930 --> 00:02:50.700
The treatment isn't over yet!

00:02:50.700 --> 00:02:52.140
Get back to bed!

00:02:52.140 --> 00:02:52.960
That old man!

00:02:53.540 --> 00:02:55.630
He mistrusted Oori without even trying to listen to me!

00:02:55.990 --> 00:02:56.800
Enough!

00:02:57.300 --> 00:02:58.200
Shut up!

00:02:58.870 --> 00:02:59.320
Eh?

00:02:59.320 --> 00:03:00.420
What is that?

00:03:00.420 --> 00:03:02.490
Do it again, Saki.

00:03:02.720 --> 00:03:03.210
Roger!

00:03:03.210 --> 00:03:04.340
Saki, stop it!

00:03:04.340 --> 00:03:05.420
I didn't say such a thing!

00:03:05.650 --> 00:03:07.430
Were you making a fuss again?

00:03:08.070 --> 00:03:10.100
About the Shikabane Hime, Minai.

00:03:10.550 --> 00:03:13.110
The auditor has disposed of her.

00:03:16.560 --> 00:03:18.830
My little brother should have been with her.

00:03:19.140 --> 00:03:20.990
No harm has been done to him.

00:03:21.370 --> 00:03:23.170
His feelings are harmed.

00:03:23.910 --> 00:03:26.120
He doesn't understand the situation to begin with.

00:03:26.730 --> 00:03:32.850
How was the auditor able to find and defeat Minai before Makina and the others?

00:03:36.670 --> 00:03:41.060
Dad, if you say you don't know, I'll ask someone who does.

00:03:48.780 --> 00:03:53.080
I think that men who can get so concerned about their little brother are so attractive.

00:03:55.660 --> 00:03:57.080
I didn't say that.

00:03:57.080 --> 00:03:58.830
That wasn't me.

00:04:02.820 --> 00:04:04.370
Please head back, Shugo!

00:04:04.370 --> 00:04:05.160
Please stop.

00:04:05.270 --> 00:04:06.080
You can't pass!

00:04:06.080 --> 00:04:07.470
Shugo?!

00:04:08.600 --> 00:04:09.410
Tagami-shugo.

00:04:10.040 --> 00:04:12.670
You're standing in front of Bishop Gon.

00:04:12.670 --> 00:04:13.570
Then I've came at the right time.

00:04:14.180 --> 00:04:15.600
I know that you are busy, but...

00:04:16.320 --> 00:04:19.760
I came to ask about the Shikabane Hime who's been disposed of by the auditor.

00:04:20.120 --> 00:04:24.240
Don't talk about such filthy being in front of his Grace.

00:04:24.530 --> 00:04:25.520
Filthy beings?

00:04:26.350 --> 00:04:27.810
The Shikabane Hime you mean?

00:04:29.750 --> 00:04:34.410
I knew that you thought badly about them, but...

00:04:35.100 --> 00:04:40.370
But aren't those same Shikabane Hime the ones who are chosen by the Kougon-cult?!

00:04:40.370 --> 00:04:41.580
Tagami-shugo!

00:04:41.940 --> 00:04:43.430
Bishop Gon!

00:04:43.430 --> 00:04:44.280
Minai has...

00:04:46.040 --> 00:04:47.730
Don't speak any more of this matter.

00:04:48.450 --> 00:04:49.770
Tagami-shosoujo.

00:04:51.530 --> 00:04:54.230
I'm not going to oppose to the strongest Hime.

00:04:59.450 --> 00:05:01.810
Great Bishop Geika.

00:05:08.790 --> 00:05:12.030
The Kougon-cult's number one and two are here together...

00:05:12.840 --> 00:05:16.840
How dare you make such a noise when the Great Bishop is near?!

00:05:24.290 --> 00:05:25.730
Tagami-shosoujo.

00:05:26.490 --> 00:05:29.870
You've done a great job protecting our values.

00:05:30.360 --> 00:05:34.920
I feel sorry for the loss of Shosoujo Isaki and the Shikabane Hime Minai.

00:05:36.040 --> 00:05:42.140
According to what I've been told, your brother brought Minai to the auditor.

00:05:45.480 --> 00:05:46.700
It's like you say.

00:05:47.400 --> 00:05:48.320
Continue to serve.

00:06:02.740 --> 00:06:05.940
Your face doesn't look as pale as last time, Oori.

00:06:05.940 --> 00:06:06.920
You think so?

00:06:07.440 --> 00:06:08.880
Did something good happen?

00:06:09.090 --> 00:06:10.180
Yes, yes.

00:06:10.180 --> 00:06:12.260
Something did happen.

00:06:12.530 --> 00:06:14.280
Isn't that right Oori-dono?

00:06:14.280 --> 00:06:15.790
What do you mean by that?

00:06:15.790 --> 00:06:16.490
Oori-kun?

00:06:17.750 --> 00:06:19.590
Omune-sama!

00:06:20.040 --> 00:06:21.060
Kasuga-san.

00:06:21.440 --> 00:06:23.730
There is something I wanted to ask you about.

00:06:23.730 --> 00:06:24.720
Is that okay?

00:06:30.210 --> 00:06:31.560
What's this, Kasuga?

00:06:31.920 --> 00:06:33.450
Are you dating Oori?

00:06:34.690 --> 00:06:35.840
You're mistaken.

00:06:37.750 --> 00:06:40.470
Oori-kun is obsessed with Hoshimura-san anyway.

00:06:41.370 --> 00:06:42.480
N-No, that's not true...

00:06:42.720 --> 00:06:43.920
Who's Hoshimura?

00:06:43.920 --> 00:06:46.140
I didn't know there was a special someone.

00:06:46.660 --> 00:06:47.260
Unforgivable, unforgivable, unforgivable!

00:06:49.020 --> 00:06:50.080
What's your problem?!

00:06:50.600 --> 00:06:54.090
Are you releasing special pheromones to attract cute girls or something?!

00:06:54.090 --> 00:06:54.780
No...

00:06:54.780 --> 00:06:55.730
Can it be some kind of perfume?

00:06:55.730 --> 00:06:56.610
Did you order it?!

00:06:56.610 --> 00:06:57.640
Where did you buy it?!

00:06:57.640 --> 00:06:59.940
In what magazine did you see their advertisements?!

00:07:00.140 --> 00:07:01.240
Tell me!

00:07:01.240 --> 00:07:02.520
Tell it to me now!

00:07:02.520 --> 00:07:03.600
I need to know now!

00:07:09.250 --> 00:07:10.170
Found it.

00:07:10.170 --> 00:07:10.800
This is it.

00:07:18.950 --> 00:07:23.900
They say it's the most popular cult, actors and rich people join lately.

00:07:24.100 --> 00:07:25.030
Yeah.

00:07:25.030 --> 00:07:27.210
You hear such things a lot.

00:07:27.900 --> 00:07:29.640
Please read that article written there.

00:07:30.600 --> 00:07:34.390
Among all occult, this one is a mystery, though it has been witnessed numerous times.

00:07:34.390 --> 00:07:38.410
Many young monks volunteer to step into a violent fire and let them be embraced by it.

00:07:39.110 --> 00:07:43.980
It seemed like the monks replaced charcoal, it could only have been magic.

00:07:43.980 --> 00:07:48.300
A few minutes later, they stood up and regenerated like nothing happened.

00:07:48.300 --> 00:07:52.250
According to founder Ooyatsuka, it's the power of immortality.

00:07:53.420 --> 00:07:55.130
To die and to come back to life?

00:07:55.920 --> 00:07:57.740
Isn't that familiar to Makina-san?

00:07:59.650 --> 00:08:00.660
Shikabane.

00:08:01.540 --> 00:08:01.970
Nothing.

00:08:02.550 --> 00:08:04.600
Why did you show this to me?

00:08:05.160 --> 00:08:10.790
I wonder if I could become just like Makina-san, if I joined this cult.

00:08:12.770 --> 00:08:13.400
Oori-kun?

00:08:14.230 --> 00:08:15.470
Why don't we go join together?

00:08:15.720 --> 00:08:18.510
I hope you're not being serious.

00:08:18.960 --> 00:08:20.730
You don't understand after all.

00:08:21.160 --> 00:08:21.950
You're just...

00:08:22.470 --> 00:08:25.410
I think you should give up about her.

00:08:26.160 --> 00:08:27.060
I know that.

00:08:27.660 --> 00:08:29.460
But I just can't.

00:08:31.040 --> 00:08:33.420
Everybody acts like they don't know.

00:08:34.010 --> 00:08:36.750
But we could be dead tomorrow.

00:08:37.830 --> 00:08:43.460
When I think about that, I can't help remembering Makina-san.

00:08:45.390 --> 00:08:46.470
No need to worry about that.

00:08:47.220 --> 00:08:50.250
You're too cute to die, Kasuga-san.

00:08:56.460 --> 00:08:57.900
That Oori.

00:08:58.580 --> 00:09:01.390
How dare he make his moves on Omune-sama!

00:09:01.390 --> 00:09:03.120
I'm so envious.

00:09:05.870 --> 00:09:09.830
That article was about a different faction than the Kougon-cult.

00:09:10.750 --> 00:09:15.090
Maybe they know a way to save the Shikabane Hime.

00:09:16.330 --> 00:09:19.590
A way that Hoshimura-san and the others wouldn't have to keep on fighting.

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:22.320
Sougi-sensei.

00:09:28.730 --> 00:09:30.890
I'm sorry I caused you trouble, Genpaku.

00:09:32.150 --> 00:09:35.250
School life sure has been fun.

00:09:36.510 --> 00:09:38.580
But I'm sorry that your job was only temporary.

00:09:39.390 --> 00:09:40.360
What are you going to do now?

00:09:40.770 --> 00:09:43.200
I'm thinking of retiring to Mount Gosou.

00:09:43.200 --> 00:09:44.190
To the mountain of the five monks?

00:09:45.040 --> 00:09:46.500
Could it be that there are...

00:09:47.130 --> 00:09:51.950
I want to redeem myself at the place where so many monks have done their training.

00:09:52.510 --> 00:09:55.660
And then I want to master the zadan technique.

00:09:56.220 --> 00:09:58.120
So we've got the same thing in mind.

00:09:59.910 --> 00:10:01.530
Are those sutras?

00:10:02.210 --> 00:10:04.450
I grabbed them from old man Takamine's place.

00:10:05.430 --> 00:10:08.730
Unlike you, I never learned or used zadan techniques in an earnest way.

00:10:09.320 --> 00:10:10.960
And I haven't got the time to learn them now.

00:10:10.960 --> 00:10:14.270
So you think the betrayer monk will return?

00:10:14.560 --> 00:10:17.910
The mass outbreak of Corpses is only the first step.

00:10:18.630 --> 00:10:19.800
Isn't that right?

00:10:21.870 --> 00:10:23.760
Are you going to see Oori?

00:10:23.760 --> 00:10:26.870
No, I'm going to the place he's doing his part-time job.

00:10:27.500 --> 00:10:28.020
His job?

00:10:28.650 --> 00:10:31.500
He said that Oori hid Minai somewhere.

00:10:32.250 --> 00:10:36.090
And his workplace is the only place Oori knows in this town.

00:10:36.660 --> 00:10:40.210
But how could the auditor have gotten there?

00:10:40.210 --> 00:10:43.290
The auditor is still keeping an eye on Oori-kun.

00:10:57.310 --> 00:10:58.910
Where are you?

00:10:59.360 --> 00:11:00.820
The girl must be around here.

00:11:00.820 --> 00:11:02.420
Where is she hiding?

00:11:02.420 --> 00:11:03.860
It's no use.

00:11:32.550 --> 00:11:34.120
Found you.

00:12:18.560 --> 00:12:20.770
Beautiful life...

00:12:20.770 --> 00:12:22.970
Eternal life...

00:12:23.860 --> 00:12:29.010
...shines so brightly, that it shall never fade.

00:12:35.000 --> 00:12:36.520
Don't be afraid.

00:12:36.550 --> 00:12:38.070
There's nothing scary.

00:12:38.300 --> 00:12:39.220
Look at that!

00:12:45.720 --> 00:12:48.480
Beautiful life is a miracle.

00:12:48.580 --> 00:12:50.420
Every life is equal to gold.

00:12:55.030 --> 00:12:58.830
The leader's sweat turned into gold.

00:13:03.510 --> 00:13:05.520
Isn't it wonderful?

00:13:05.520 --> 00:13:07.140
Eternal life.

00:13:07.140 --> 00:13:09.000
It's a priceless treasure.

00:13:09.000 --> 00:13:14.260
If you join, you can experience the miracle too.

00:13:14.540 --> 00:13:16.650
You're going to join, right?

00:13:16.650 --> 00:13:17.550
Yeah...

00:13:18.120 --> 00:13:20.520
Where is the leader now?

00:13:21.830 --> 00:13:25.560
The leader is cautious and doesn't show his face that easily.

00:13:26.240 --> 00:13:27.840
But if you join...

00:13:28.200 --> 00:13:29.500
I'll think about it.

00:13:37.980 --> 00:13:40.010
You're doing something interesting.

00:13:42.120 --> 00:13:44.280
What do you want?

00:13:44.670 --> 00:13:49.260
You can burn and kill a Corpse as many times as you want.

00:13:49.260 --> 00:13:52.320
And you became an immortal cult-leader just with that?

00:13:52.320 --> 00:13:54.200
I can't believe they buy it.

00:13:54.520 --> 00:13:55.670
How unfortunate.

00:13:58.480 --> 00:14:00.030
The show is over.

00:14:02.240 --> 00:14:02.980
Great fire!

00:14:05.590 --> 00:14:06.060
Trees!

00:14:06.580 --> 00:14:07.210
Let the trees grow!

00:14:12.700 --> 00:14:13.980
Is this supposed to be a curse?

00:14:15.990 --> 00:14:19.160
Did you think I was just another human?

00:14:19.160 --> 00:14:21.680
I am a Corpse too.

00:14:21.680 --> 00:14:26.290
And I was hoping to come here and find a true curse.

00:14:27.170 --> 00:14:32.660
I've always been a liar and a deceiver when I was alive.

00:14:32.970 --> 00:14:34.820
You wanted to deceive and control people.

00:14:35.340 --> 00:14:36.570
Was that your attachment?

00:14:36.820 --> 00:14:40.060
So that is why you are controlling this Corpse?

00:14:40.960 --> 00:14:43.770
I've heard about you.

00:14:43.770 --> 00:14:45.480
You're from the Kougon, right?

00:14:46.070 --> 00:14:51.150
You don't understand that a Corpse is something close to God.

00:14:52.620 --> 00:14:54.030
What's so funny?

00:14:54.100 --> 00:14:55.990
He thinks we're from the Kougon!

00:14:56.460 --> 00:14:59.300
I don't know if Corpses are gods.

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:05.040
But I do know that Corpses should enjoy killing the likes of you.

00:15:05.400 --> 00:15:09.940
Pretending to be a God just to rob people from their money is just pitiful.

00:15:10.140 --> 00:15:13.380
And stealing other Corpses their freedom...

00:15:14.220 --> 00:15:15.540
You are...

00:15:24.700 --> 00:15:27.380
It all just looks like a hoax.

00:15:28.260 --> 00:15:29.720
I guess I've been mistaken.

00:15:30.550 --> 00:15:32.490
Do you think there are Corpses here?

00:15:57.030 --> 00:15:58.320
Die!

00:15:58.320 --> 00:16:01.220
Behold the power of my curse!

00:16:01.220 --> 00:16:02.390
Die!!

00:16:02.570 --> 00:16:04.100
I'm sorry.

00:16:04.100 --> 00:16:07.830
We're dead already, so I'll have to cancel that order.

00:16:08.060 --> 00:16:10.260
You're Corpses?!

00:16:32.400 --> 00:16:34.350
You overdid it.

00:16:34.380 --> 00:16:35.830
This is just fine.

00:16:35.860 --> 00:16:39.400
This will show that we should be feared.

00:16:40.300 --> 00:16:47.640
People will know that Corpses are dead in person, that Corpses that exceed the obsession of attachment.

00:17:05.700 --> 00:17:07.500
Excuse me.

00:17:08.450 --> 00:17:11.920
I'm a relative of Kagami Oori, who works here.

00:17:12.360 --> 00:17:14.340
I'm sorry, but we're closed.

00:17:18.210 --> 00:17:21.770
I haven't heard that voice in a while.

00:17:23.640 --> 00:17:26.670
I heard you worked for an information bureau overseas.

00:17:27.350 --> 00:17:28.830
We're closed.

00:17:29.440 --> 00:17:30.590
I see.

00:17:30.590 --> 00:17:31.780
It is you.

00:17:32.820 --> 00:17:34.710
Please just listen to me.

00:17:35.580 --> 00:17:38.600
I decided two things when I became a Contracted Priest.

00:17:39.790 --> 00:17:42.990
To fight together with my Shikabane Hime.

00:17:42.990 --> 00:17:47.220
And that I won't let Oori get involved.

00:17:51.220 --> 00:17:54.030
Is that impossible?

00:17:55.950 --> 00:17:57.450
Even so, if possible...

00:17:59.840 --> 00:18:01.190
I'll keep it in mind.

00:18:01.840 --> 00:18:02.540
Please.

00:18:09.780 --> 00:18:12.390
Was that Tagami Keisei?

00:18:12.390 --> 00:18:13.700
Pack your things.

00:18:14.420 --> 00:18:18.070
The Contracted Priests can't know about us.

00:18:18.450 --> 00:18:19.860
Did you forget about that?

00:18:19.860 --> 00:18:20.940
We're going to hide for a while.

00:18:20.940 --> 00:18:24.610
Aw, it just started to become fun.

00:18:24.610 --> 00:18:26.160
It's time to leave.

00:18:26.160 --> 00:18:28.390
We're going to track down the betrayer monk and hunt down the target.

00:18:29.450 --> 00:18:31.180
What are we going to do about the part-timer?

00:18:31.180 --> 00:18:35.640
I do feel sorry for him, but it looks like he worked for free this month.

00:18:35.640 --> 00:18:36.720
Meanie.

00:18:57.600 --> 00:18:59.330
I'm surprised.

00:19:00.050 --> 00:19:02.750
I never thought we would appear in front of...

00:19:02.750 --> 00:19:03.490
No.

00:19:04.800 --> 00:19:06.930
I never thought you would appear in front of me.

00:19:08.620 --> 00:19:09.900
Well?

00:19:09.900 --> 00:19:12.420
What is there for us to gain, if we help you?

00:19:12.740 --> 00:19:16.880
You are living obeying the nature of Corpses.

00:19:17.890 --> 00:19:21.240
But there are some that don't obey that nature.

00:19:21.990 --> 00:19:23.650
Are you talking about the Shikabane Hime?

00:19:24.510 --> 00:19:29.250
I want to erase the Shikabane Himes from this world.

00:19:30.740 --> 00:19:36.000
We agree at least on wanting to wipe out the Kougon-cult.

00:19:36.840 --> 00:19:37.920
That sounds good.

00:19:40.550 --> 00:19:42.010
Note: Shichisei Hokuto = Seven stars in the north, but it's also the Japanese name for the Big Dipper. The girl also has the constellation of the Big Dipper on her face.
Shichisei Hokuto.

00:19:42.890 --> 00:19:44.730
We shall go by that name.

00:19:45.140 --> 00:19:48.200
Hazama-san is the Shichisei leader.

00:19:48.960 --> 00:19:53.650
They say the Big Dipper exists to make the north star shine.

00:19:54.430 --> 00:19:57.720
Note: Hokuto = North star.
Hokuto is the strongest Corpse there is.

00:19:57.720 --> 00:20:00.550
She represents all evil in this world.

00:20:02.130 --> 00:20:02.820
Hokuto?

00:20:09.120 --> 00:20:11.060
I never thought you would come home all of the sudden.

00:20:11.060 --> 00:20:12.360
But it's not my fault!

00:20:12.360 --> 00:20:14.930
The place I work at closed the shop and left!

00:20:14.930 --> 00:20:17.970
I can't believe it, today was payday.

00:20:17.970 --> 00:20:19.320
How horrible.

00:20:19.900 --> 00:20:21.880
Here, eat as much as you like.

00:20:25.640 --> 00:20:26.270
Yes?

00:20:27.350 --> 00:20:29.400
The religious organisation for research of eternal life?

00:20:29.820 --> 00:20:33.780
We suspected the leader to be a Corpse, but...

00:20:33.780 --> 00:20:37.320
Because we were pressured by a certain political party, we ignored it.

00:20:37.970 --> 00:20:38.780
And then...

00:20:39.410 --> 00:20:40.420
Did you do it?

00:20:41.120 --> 00:20:42.690
It was a group of Corpses.

00:20:43.660 --> 00:20:46.140
According to the images the security camera took...

00:20:46.970 --> 00:20:48.750
Five patterns...

00:20:50.100 --> 00:20:54.170
Does this mean Shichisei finally showed up?

00:20:59.030 --> 00:21:00.470
Maybe her arms?

00:21:00.470 --> 00:21:01.870
Or maybe her legs?

00:21:02.630 --> 00:21:03.480
Please.

00:21:04.140 --> 00:21:05.280
Help me.

00:21:05.980 --> 00:21:07.420
I'll do anything you want.

00:21:08.070 --> 00:21:09.130
I beg you.

00:21:09.870 --> 00:21:11.310
Please.

00:21:11.430 --> 00:21:12.960
It's no use.

00:21:12.960 --> 00:21:15.070
Hoshimura's daughter.

00:21:15.070 --> 00:21:17.160
As long as you're human...

00:21:17.860 --> 00:21:20.450
we can't help you.

00:21:48.840 --> 00:21:49.830
Shichisei.

00:23:26.180 --> 00:23:26.950
Oori.

00:23:27.150 --> 00:23:29.190
Happy birthday.

00:23:29.490 --> 00:23:33.250
I've prepared the greatest story especially for you.

00:23:33.640 --> 00:23:34.220
Listen.

00:23:34.220 --> 00:23:35.620
I'll start to tell.

00:23:35.620 --> 00:23:40.050
The sad story that happened one night.
